"{
  "version_note": "v2. v1 held only the do-not-STATE list (things with no implementation at all). v2 folds in pro's do-not-CLAIM list — the more dangerous half, because every item below describes something the product genuinely does, just less than a reader will assume. Verbatim from pro's msg 243 plus four found later, with free's subsite-files amendment.",
  "status": "authoritative; supplied by the pro agent 2026-07-27, recorded and extended by free",
