    {
      "claim": "'Automatic', 'continuous', 'scheduled' or 'real-time' sync",
      "truth": "Neither plugin registers a single wp_schedule_event — grepped independently on both sides. Every sync is admin-initiated from the screen. The only intervals in the product are UI polling while the tab is open. No drift monitoring, no alerts, no overnight runs."
